SG13G2 gm/ID Lookup
Copyright 2026 Hidayet Eren Uludağ

This product includes lookup tables generated by simulating the IHP SG13G2
MOSFET models (PSP103) from the IHP-Open-PDK:
  https://github.com/IHP-GmbH/IHP-Open-PDK
  Copyright IHP GmbH, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The calculator layout follows the Open-LUT web tool:
  S. A. Khalid, S. E. Maestre and K. M. Madrid-Khalid, "Open-LUT: Interactive
  gm/ID Lookup Tables for MOSFET Sizing in Open-Source PDKs," ICICM 2025,
  doi:10.1109/ICICM66614.2025.11316023. No Open-LUT code or data is included.
